## 4. Backend API Specification

Base URL: `https://api.attendify.app/api/v1`

### 4.1 Authentication

| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|:---|:---|:---|
| `POST` | `/auth/register` | Register a new user (student/teacher) |
| `POST` | `/auth/login` | Authenticate and receive JWT token |
| `GET` | `/auth/me` | Get current user profile |

### 4.2 Attendance

| Method | Endpoint | Description | Called By |
|:---|:---|:---|:---|
| `POST` | `/attendance/manual` | Submit manual attendance for a lecture | Teacher App |
| `POST` | `/attendance/recognise` | **AI endpoint** — log a recognised student | Recognition Engine |
| `GET` | `/attendance/student/{id}` | Get attendance history for a student | Student App |
| `GET` | `/attendance/lecture/{id}` | Get attendance list for a lecture | Teacher App |
| `PATCH` | `/attendance/{id}` | Override/correct an attendance record | Teacher App |

### 4.3 Recognition & Enrollment

| Method | Endpoint | Description | Called By |
|:---|:---|:---|:---|
| `POST` | `/enrollment/photos` | Upload 3-5 face photos for a student | Student App |
| `GET` | `/enrollment/photos/{student_id}` | Retrieve enrolled photo URLs | Recognition Engine |
| `DELETE` | `/enrollment/photos/{photo_id}` | Remove an enrollment photo | Student App |

### 4.4 Lectures & Schedule

| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|:---|:---|:---|
| `POST` | `/lectures` | Create a new lecture slot |
| `GET` | `/lectures?class_id=X&date=Y` | Get lectures for a class on a date |
| `PUT` | `/lectures/{id}` | Update lecture details |

### 4.5 Notifications

| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|:---|:---|:---|
| `POST` | `/notifications/broadcast` | Teacher sends notification to a class |
| `GET` | `/notifications/me` | Get notifications for current user |

### 4.6 AI Recognition Endpoint — Detail

```
POST /api/v1/attendance/recognise
```

**Request Body:**
```json
{
  "student_id": "uuid",
  "lecture_id": "uuid",
  "confidence_score": 0.87,
  "frame_timestamp": "2026-02-14T13:05:22Z",
  "camera_id": "cam-room-301"
}
```

**Response (201 Created):**
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "attendance_id": "uuid",
  "message": "Attendance marked for Rahul Sharma (Roll 42)"
}
```

**Response (409 Conflict — Duplicate):**
```json
{
  "success": false,
  "message": "Attendance already recorded for this student in this lecture"
}
```

**Response (422 — Low Confidence):**
```json
{
  "success": false,
  "message": "Confidence below threshold (0.87 required, got 0.54). Flagged for review."
}
```

