## 8. Screen Breakdown

### 8.1 Student Interface (5 Tabs)

| # | Tab | Screen | Key Features |
|:---|:---|:---|:---|
| 1 | 🏠 Dashboard | `dashboard.tsx` | Welcome card, today's schedule, attendance donut chart, quick actions |
| 2 | 📋 Attendance | `attendance.tsx` | Subject-wise %, lecture-by-lecture history, Present/Absent status pills |
| 3 | 📅 Schedule | `schedule.tsx` | Day-wise lecture timeline (subject, time, room, teacher name) |
| 4 | 🔔 Notifications | `notifications.tsx` | Schedule changes, announcements, low-attendance alerts |
| 5 | 👤 Profile | `profile.tsx` | Personal info, **Enroll Face** (upload 3-5 photos), theme toggle, logout |

### 8.2 Teacher Interface (6 Tabs)

| # | Tab | Screen | Key Features |
|:---|:---|:---|:---|
| 1 | 🏠 Dashboard | `dashboard.tsx` | Class-wise strength summary, today's lectures, recent activity feed |
| 2 | ✅ Attendance | `mark-attendance.tsx` | **Manual mode** (roll-call checklist) · **AI Monitor mode** (live recognition feed) |
| 3 | 👥 Students | `students.tsx` | Search / filter by class, individual attendance history, export data |
| 4 | 📅 Schedule | `schedule.tsx` | Create / edit / delete lecture slots |
| 5 | 🔔 Notifications | `notifications.tsx` | Compose & broadcast announcements to selected classes |
| 6 | 👤 Profile | `profile.tsx` | Personal info, department, theme toggle, logout |

