## 9. Core Flows

### 9.1 Manual Attendance (Teacher)
```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant T as Teacher
    participant App as Mobile App
    participant API as Backend API
    participant DB as Database

    T->>App: Open "Mark Attendance" → Manual tab
    App->>API: GET /lectures?teacher_id=X&date=today
    API-->>App: List of today's lectures
    T->>App: Select lecture
    App->>API: GET /attendance/lecture/{id}
    API-->>App: Student list with current status
    T->>App: Mark each student Present / Absent
    T->>App: Tap "Submit"
    App->>API: POST /attendance/manual {lecture_id, records:[...]}
    API->>DB: UPSERT attendance rows (method: Manual)
    DB-->>API: 201 Created
    API-->>App: Success response
    App-->>T: "Attendance saved" confirmation
```

### 9.2 AI Automatic Attendance (No Human Intervention)
```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant CAM as CCTV Camera
    participant ENG as Recognition Engine
    participant API as Backend API
    participant DB as Database
    participant TAPP as Teacher App

    Note over CAM,ENG: Runs continuously during lecture hours
    loop Every 500ms
        CAM->>ENG: Send video frame
        ENG->>ENG: Detect faces (Haar/HOG)
    end

    ENG->>ENG: Face detected — extract embedding
    ENG->>ENG: Match against enrolled class embeddings
    ENG->>ENG: Match found — confidence 92%

    ENG->>API: POST /attendance/recognise {student_id, lecture_id, confidence: 0.92}
    API->>API: Deduplication — student not yet marked
    API->>DB: INSERT attendance (status: Present, method: AI, confidence: 0.92)
    DB-->>API: 201 Created
    API-->>ENG: {success: true}

    API-->>TAPP: Real-time update → "Rahul Sharma marked Present (AI)"
```

### 9.3 Student Photo Enrollment
```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant S as Student
    participant App as Mobile App
    participant API as Backend API
    participant Store as Supabase Storage
    participant DB as Database

    S->>App: Profile → "Enroll Face"
    App-->>S: Show photo grid (5 slots)
    S->>App: Capture / pick photo
    App->>App: Compress image (≤ 500 KB)
    App->>API: POST /enrollment/photos (multipart)
    API->>Store: Upload to student-faces/{student_id}/photo_{n}.jpg
    Store-->>API: Return signed URL
    API->>DB: INSERT into student_photos (photo_url, photo_index)
    DB-->>API: 201 Created
    API-->>App: {photo_url, photo_index}
    App-->>S: Show thumbnail with ✓ badge
```

