## 12. Verification Checklist

| # | Test Case | Expected Outcome |
|:---|:---|:---|
| 1 | Student registers | Redirected to Student tab navigator |
| 2 | Teacher registers | Redirected to Teacher tab navigator |
| 3 | Student uploads 5 photos | Photos in `student-faces/{id}/`, rows in `student_photos` |
| 4 | Teacher marks manual attendance | `attendance` rows with `method: Manual` |
| 5 | Camera detects enrolled student | API receives POST, `attendance` row with `method: AI` |
| 6 | Duplicate AI recognition | API returns 409, no duplicate row created |
| 7 | Low-confidence match (< 70%) | API returns 422, record flagged for review |
| 8 | Teacher overrides AI result | `attendance.status` updated via PATCH |
| 9 | Student views attendance | Correct percentages, lecture-level history |
| 10 | Teacher broadcasts notification | All students in class receive push alert |
| 11 | Dark mode toggle | All screens render correctly |
| 12 | Network loss → reconnect | Queued operations sync automatically |

---

## 13. Risk Assessment & Mitigation

| # | Risk | Severity | Mitigation Strategy |
|:---|:---|:---|:---|
| 1 | Face recognition inaccuracy | High | Confidence threshold + teacher override capability |
| 2 | Poor quality enrollment photos | Medium | In-app guidelines (lighting, angle checklist) + validation |
| 3 | CCTV stream latency / dropout | Medium | Buffered frame processing + graceful reconnection |
| 4 | Supabase free-tier storage limits | Low | Client-side compression (≤ 500 KB) + usage monitoring |
| 5 | Network outage in classroom | Medium | Local queue on device + automatic sync on reconnect |
| 6 | Unauthorized API access | High | JWT authentication + RLS policies on all tables |
| 7 | Student impersonation (photo of a photo) | Medium | Liveness detection in future iteration |
